ryzen-control (0.8.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * APUs of desktops, mini PCs and laptops (expected): fast/slow PPT, Tctl,
    TDC/EDC read back from the PM table; Quiet and Performance.
  * Laptops: the baseline records the power source; the reapply timer and a
    udev rule write the profile's limits again after the firmware's rewrites.
  * Default chosen by hand keeps "Apply at startup" (after a crash, "Stay on
    Default" still turns it off).

